* Standard nine buttons with long notes in the #LNTYPE 1 notation: buttons 1..9 = 11 12 13 14 15 22 23 24 25; long-note channels follow the same mapping (51-55, 62-65).
* UTF-8 with BOM and CRLF line ends on purpose.
* Hand-written synthetic chart (CC0 / public domain) built from the BMS and PMS fiches of vsrg-format-docs.

#PLAYER 3
#GENRE Test
#TITLE Synthetic PMS long notes
#SUBTITLE [9 buttons, LN]
#ARTIST vsrg-format-docs
#BPM 130
#PLAYLEVEL 10
#RANK 2
#TOTAL 300
#LNTYPE 1

#WAV01 bgm.ogg
#WAV02 tap.wav

#00001:01

* measure 0: long notes on button 1 (channel 51), button 5 (channel 55), button 6 (channel 62) and button 9 (channel 65); head slot 0, tail slot 4 of 8
#00051:0200000002000000
#00055:0200000002000000
#00062:0200000002000000
#00065:0200000002000000

* measure 1: taps on buttons 2, 3, 4, 7, 8 (channels 12 13 14 23 24)
#00112:0200000000000000
#00113:0002000000000000
#00114:0000020000000000
#00123:0000000200000000
#00124:0000000002000000
